  rdfs:comment "A form of gender expression that seeks to subvert the gender binary or gender roles by mixing and messing with (or \"fucking with\") traditionally masculine and feminine components. Typically used to describe gender practices and presentation, though some people identify as \"genderfuck\" or as \"genderfuckers.\" Only use to describe people and the practices of people who self-identify with genderfuck.";
  skos:changeNote "Version 3.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000581>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
